00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:41.760
And everything that you saw here just&nbsp;
happened not within the last few years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:50.160
but within the last few days. Wow. That is the&nbsp;
amazing time we live in today. What a time to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:56.220
